y></table><br><p>Remember when I mentioned AbiWord doesn't need GNOME 1.4? =
Well, I reasoned that a lot of the extra software preinstalled in RedHat mo=
st likely contributes to the minimum RAM requirements, and I ran several te=
sts today in Virtual Box, from 64MB to 7MB. 7MB could reach the bootloader,=
 but it could not proceed further than that. 16MB could load most applicati=
ons, and even 12MB, albeit a bit slower. It would also lag if multiple wind=
ows like Nautilus were open while a browser and/or other smaller apps were =
open.</p><div class=3D"separator" style=3D"clear: both; text-align: center;=
"><iframe allowfullscreen=3D"allowfullscreen" class=3D"b-hbp-video b-upload=
ed" frameborder=3D"0" height=3D"437" id=3D"BLOGGER-video-04b02cb6c8893457-9=
